<h1>FOXHOLE RADIO LAB</h1>
<p class="sub">From a Razor Blade to Radio Waves — Understanding Passive AM Radio Reception.</p>
<p class="big">A radio with no battery and no amplifier. Energy from the broadcast itself is selected by a tuned circuit, detected by a crude razor-blade and graphite contact, and heard in a sensitive earphone.</p>
<div class="btns"><a class="btn" href="#lab">Explore the Simulation</a><a class="btn" href="#circuit">Understand the Circuit</a><button onclick="openPres()">Start Expo Presentation</button></div></div>
