"Very weak sound":["Short antenna, poor return, coil losses, weak station, partial tuning, weak detector contact.","Lengthen/raise antenna safely, tune slowly for peak, test different blade spots, check earphone type."],
"Reception changes when touching the pencil":["Contact resistance changes with pressure and position; your body also changes stray capacitance.","Use a light fixed clamp, avoid touching during demo, probe slowly to find a stable spot."],
"Station cannot be tuned":["L and C do not cover the band, large parasitic capacitance, coil shorted turns, antenna loading shifts f₀.","Calculate f₀ for your L and C, adjust turns or capacitor range, check for shorted turns."],
"Signal disappears when moving the antenna":["Changed pickup, loose antenna joint, antenna touching other conductors or screened by metal.","Secure the joint, keep the wire clear, find a stable position. Keep it far from power lines."]};
